{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nN__M8cnKfbSJ_25YidIZw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:19.631433+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nN__M8cnKfbSJ_25YidIZw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/L2CfzS9cS4W0Kl0sfpBB5r4tdI9M5ibKvHCFNjuKiaXYlOonWuJqqAU1OI9kXjFGwv5e3HZXmUq8PB2q81IyWdcA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>西南民族大学中国语言文学学院竭诚欢迎全国高校优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读研究生。现就我院2026年接收优秀应届本科生免试攻读研究生报名工作通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>一、招收专业及人数</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.我院文艺学、语言学及应用语言学、汉语言文字学、中国古典文献学、中国古代文学、中国现当代文学、中国少数民族语言文学、和比较文学与世界文学专业均接收校内外推荐免试研究生。</span></p><p><span>2.我院中国语言文学一级学科中国少数民族语言文学方向接收推免直博生。</span></p><p><span>3.具体招收专业目录以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”）正式公布为准。</span></p><p><span>4.各专业拟录取推免生人数最终以“推免服务系统”确认的录取人数为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，拥护社会主义制度，遵纪守法，品德良好，具有强烈的社会责任感。</span></p><p><span>2.具备研究生培养的基础和潜质。学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新精神、创新能力和专业能力。</span></p><p><span>3.学风端正。无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，未受过任何处分。</span></p><p><span>4.获得毕业学校推荐免试资格的2026届优秀应届本科毕业生。研究生入学前获得本科毕业证和学位证。</span></p><p><span>5.申请直博生须提供两位所报考学科专业领域内的高级职称专家的书面推荐意见。</span></p><p><span>6.身体健康状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检标准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>三、招收程序</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）预报名：教育部“推免服务系统”开通前。</span></p><p><span>符合报考条件的推免生，扫描下面二维码，填报相关信息报名：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/L2CfzS9cS4W0Kl0sfpBB5r4tdI9M5ibKvA0ianNLQdiazvJ3tjosRppWJt9VyznQLeuD8QIpKYwQtM04Q5v0Fw5MA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>审核通过的学生请及时关注学院网站、西南民族大学研究生院官网通知，须在教育部“推免服务系统”开通后按要求填报相应信息和志愿，规定时间内未在教育部“推免服务系统”中选报我校的推免生，视为放弃相关资格。</span></p></section><section><p><span>（二）正式报名：教育部“推免服务系统”开通后。</span></p><p><span>1.报名</span></p><p><span>推免生在规定时间内登录教育部“推免服务系统”填报个人信息并注册，按网上要求和提示如实填写有关信息完成网上报名。</span></p><p><span>2.复试</span></p><p><span>审核通过的学生参加复试，具体安排以学院的通知为准。复试采用现场或网络远程形式分批组织，具体时间、地点及其他要求，由学院确定后通知有关学生。请及时关注学院网站、西南民族大学研究生院官网。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>四、考核内容</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）包含综合面试、外语听说能力测试、思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></p><p><span>（二）考核满分200分，其中综合面试满分150分，外语测试满分50分。</span></p><p><span>（三）思想政治素质和品德考核主要考核推免生本人的现实表现，包括考生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面，考核等次为合格或不合格，该考核结论不作量化计入复试成绩，考核结果不合格者不予录取。</span></p><p><span>（四）推免生复试总成绩、单项成绩均应达到满分的60%以上（含60%），否则视为复试不合格，不予录取。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>五、体检</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>所有拟录取的推免生须在新生入学报到时参加入学体检。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>六、录取</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院将根据考核成绩从高到低择优录取。申请人须在规定时间内通过教育部“推免服务系统”确认接收复试通知、待录取通知，否则视为放弃我校复试、拟录取资格。申请人最终录取专业以“教育部推免服务系统”中确认录取的专业为准。拟录取的推免生名单将在我校研究生院网站进行公示，公示时间不少于7日。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>七、推免生激励政策（学校标准）</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.我校接收的硕士研究生推免生，在入学后的第一学年可享受一等学业奖学金8000元。</span></p><p><span>2.我校接收的推免生（含直博生）实行助学金全覆盖，博士研究生国家助学金标准为每生每年15000元，硕士研究生国家助学金标准为每生每年6000元。</span></p><p><span>3.我校接收的推免生（含直博生），在选择指导教师、科创项目申报、推荐到国内外知名院校和科研院所联合培养、境内外学术交流、三助岗位等方面予以优先支持。</span></p><p><span>4.入学后表现优秀的推免生可参评研究生国家奖学金、研究生高水平科研奖励，优先支持申请硕博连读研究生。</span></p><p><span>5.我校接收的硕士推免生可提前选修硕士一年级相关课程。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>八、其他事项（学校规定）</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）推免生必须如实、准确提交申请材料，如有弄虚作假，将取消其录取或入学资格。</span></p><p><span>（二）推免生在本科基本学制的最后一学年有成绩不合格科目、或受到纪律处分、或体检不合格的，取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（三）获得拟录取资格的推免生，新生入学报到前未获得学士学位证书和本科毕业证书，将被取消录取或入学资格。</span></p><p><span>（四）我校不收取任何复试费用。我校未委托任何中介机构或个人进行推免生招生录取工作。</span></p><p><span>（五）以上未尽事宜或有关内容与上级有关文件不一致的，依照上级相关规定执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>九、联系方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：028-85928033</span></p><p><span>邮箱：xnmdzyyjs@126.com</span></p></section></section></section></section></secti